{"product":{"id":6236625535164,"title":"Cortech Endurance X‑Series Laminate Table with Steel Legs","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCortech Endurance Steel Leg Laminate Tables, like the rest of Cortech's Endurance Series Furniture line, are ideal for continuous use in extreme environments, including compassionate and normative Behavioral Health Care Facilities, Residential Treatment Centers and Facilities, Hospital Psychiatric Units, Correctional Institutions, Mental Health Treatment Centers and other medical and public safety facilities that require the ultimate combination of durability and functional design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEndurance Steel Leg Laminate Tables are versatile, heavy duty tables designed for continuous use in dayrooms and dining areas. Cortech's Endurance X Series Tables have an extreme load capacity due to their rotational molding technology and the rounded table top edge increases safety and comfort, making it ideal for use as Dayroom\/Dining table applications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTable top size: 36\" or 42\" square, 42\" or 48\" round, 30\" x 72\" rectangle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaminate Top is seamless one-piece design with Extreme strength and impact resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe legs fastened to the table top with tamper resistant screws with metal to metal connection for added strength\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to clean and maintain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstructed of high impact polyethylene in a durable, one piece, rotationally molded design for increased strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStain resistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLegs can be easily filled with sand to weigh down as ballast\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYour choice of models:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SDPS - 36\" X 36\" Square, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SVPS - 36\" X 36\" Square, Vinyl, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SDGS - 36\" X 36\" Square, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e36SVGS - 36\" X 36\" Square, Vinyl, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SDPS - 42\" x 42\" Square, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SVPS - 42\" X 42\" Square, Vinyl, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SDGS - 42\" X 42\" Square, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42SVGS - 42\" X 42\" Square, Vinyl, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42RDPS - 42\" Round, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e42RVPS - 42\" Round, Vinyl, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RDPS - 48\" Round, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48SVPS - 48\" Round, Vinyl, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RDGS - 48\" Round, Dura-Edge, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e48RVGS - 48\" Round, Vinyl, Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3072DPS - 30\" x 72\" Rectangle, Dura-Edge, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3072VPS - 30\" x 72\" Rectangle, Vinyl, Plain Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify leg bottom: _G \u003cspan\u003eFloor Glide or _B Bolt Down (can be bolted to the floor via concealed pilot holes with exclusive Sabre Mount System)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Steel Legs are black. Plain table tops are gray. Game table tops are white\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlame Retardant (passes Cal 133) - test reports available upon request\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 Year Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech Endurance Furniture:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Cortech Endurance intense use furniture line is ideal for use as behavioral health furniture, correctional facility furniture, detention furniture, and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBehavioral Healthcare \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003emental health furniture. The Endurance Furniture Series is also a perfect fit for residential institutions, public safety facilities, detention centers, correctional institutions, prisons and any intense or high abuse applications such as drug and alcohol rehabilitation centers and addiction treatment centers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T16:07:42-05:00","handle":"cortech-endurance-x-series-laminate-table-w-steel-legs","updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:06:19-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T16:07:42-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-activity-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-dining-areas, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dayrooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-staff-room, cd-furn-cafeteria, cd-furn-dayroom, cd-furn-staff-room, cd-furn-visitation, cortech-endurance, cortech-usa, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37962689413308,"product_id":6236625535164,"title":"36SDPS - 36x36 Square, Plain, Dura-Edge","price":"2200.00","sku":"C601635-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"2750.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"36SDPS - 36x36 Square, Plain, Dura-Edge","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T16:07:44-05:00","up